&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Product launch and indication expansion experience.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Experience leading compliance initiatives within a commercial-stage biotechnology company.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Strong project leadership and change management capabilities.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
