&lt;p&gt;This is a rare opportunity to join a growing California-based biotechnology company at a pivotal stage, helping establish the legal framework for its first commercial launch in Europe. The successful candidate will play a highly visible role in enabling international commercialization, influencing business strategy, and building legal processes that will support future global expansion.&lt;/p&gt;
