&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Exceptional leadership, communication, and cross functional collaboration skills, with the ability to influence and build credibility across commercial, Market Access, and executive teams.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Advanced analytical skills and high proficiency in Microsoft Excel, Word and PowerPoint.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Maintain a positive, approachable and professional attitude.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
