&lt;p&gt;Experience supporting a first product launch, commercial launch readiness, or early commercial stage pharmaceutical or biotechnology company.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Experience supporting global consolidation, regional revenue reporting, intercompany processes.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
