&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Bachelor’s degree in a quantitative or business-related discipline.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;8+ years of progressive experience in commercial analytics, field analytics, sales analytics, commercial operations, or a related function within pharmaceutical, biotechnology, or healthcare organizations.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
