&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Bachelor’s degree in accounting, Finance, Business Administration, or a related field.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;10+ years of progressive accounting experience, including significant general ledger and financial close experience and demonstrated people leadership.&lt;/p&gt;
