&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Prior experience in oncology product launches.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Strong network within the German oncology community.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
