&lt;p&gt;Lead Open Enrollment strategy, program changes, core messaging, decision support, and overall program requirements.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Develop benefits communication and education strategies supporting Open Enrollment, new program launches, and ongoing employee understanding.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Partner with People Operations and Regional HR on implementation, localization, distribution, employee meetings, and first-line employee support.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
