&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Strong knowledge of medical compliance standards and inspection readiness best practices.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Exceptional communication, leadership, and collaboration skills, with the ability to work in a matrixed, fast-paced environment.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Preferred Skills:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Oncology and/or precision medicine experience strongly preferred.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Experience building or scaling Field Medical organizations during rapid growth or product launch phases.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
