&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Influence European and Midsised Markets access strategy based on local payer insights from a leadership position.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Travel nationally and internationally.&lt;/p&gt;
