&lt;p&gt;The role connects Product Management, Omnichannel, Field Force, Medical Affairs, Strategic Operations and Planning and other customer-facing functions, ensuring European and global strategies are translated into locally relevant, data-driven execution.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Rather than serving as a traditional planning and approval point, this leader enables an agile, cross-functional Commercial System focused on speed, relevance and customer centricity.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;This role reports to the Senior Director, Commercial, Germany. &amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
