&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Maintain expertise in disease state, competitive landscape, and market dynamics, informing potential pivots in strategic and executional approach as needed.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Partner with internal stakeholders to develop and deliver impactful customer-facing content.&lt;/p&gt;
