&lt;p&gt;Reporting to the VP, Medical Affairs, Europe, this individual will also play a critical role in preparing the European Medical team for product launches across the region in oncology, supporting field excellence, and ensuring they are equipped with the necessary knowledge and materials to communicate scientific data effectively.&lt;/p&gt;
