&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Manage development, review, and approval of high-quality labeling, including Target Labeling, Core Labeling (e.g., Company Core Data Sheet [CCDS]), and Regional Labeling (e.g., USPI, EU SmPC), in a timely manner according to internal SOPs and external regulatory requirements.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Lead cross-functional Labeling Working Group and Senior Labeling Committee meetings.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
