&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Research the content of other labels in the same therapeutic class, including competitor labeling, to help guide the team in developing labeling text, including contingency strategy development for negotiation with regulatory authorities.&lt;/p&gt;
