&lt;p&gt;The successful candidate will be a proactive business partner who balances legal risk with commercial objectives in a fast-paced launch environment.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;This is an opportunity to shape the legal strategy for one of the Company’s key European markets while partnering closely with Italian and European leadership to help build a high-performing commercial organization.&lt;/p&gt;
