&lt;p&gt;UKI Counsel: In-market legal support for the UKI affiliate, including the GM, market access, competition law, litigation, local legal issues, and business partnerships.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Distributor Markets Counsel: Cross-border commercial contracting and governance for all European distributor markets outside the company&#39;s direct affiliate footprint, with responsibility for negotiating and managing distribution relationships.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
