&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Direct experience with Phase IV drug development.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Has proven abilities to present [a] compelling business case and facilitates effective and expeditious decision-making. Has demonstrated the ability to serve as a company spokesperson both internally and externally.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Has demonstrated collaborate behaviors on enterprise-level strategic initiatives with a variety of internal and external partners and stakeholders - including clinical investigators/clinicians, scientists and key opinion leaders (KOLs), as well as internal groups, including other groups in development, research, business development, commercial, legal, etc. - resulting in demonstrable outcomes (e.g. new study proposals or new disease indications).&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Has demonstrated courage and conviction in past positions and responsibilities. Skilled in conflict resolution. &amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
