&lt;p&gt;Candidates should be passionate about leading cross-functional collaboration, building new commercial capabilities, and contributing as both a strategic leader and hands-on driver in a growing organization. This position will partner closely with internal stakeholders and external diagnostic partners to ensure global readiness for precision oncology commercialization.&lt;/p&gt;
