&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Bachelor&#39;s degree with 15+ years of relevant experience in biotech, pharmaceutical or healthcare industry, including significant experience leading complex commercial or commercialization initiatives.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
