&lt;p&gt;We are seeking a highly motivated and experienced professional to join our team as a Medical Science Liaison, Italy. Key aspects of this role will include engage in peer-to-peer scientific dialogue with healthcare professionals that translate into meaningful insights, serve as a therapeutic expert and thought partner to internal teams, liaison between Revolution Medicines and clinical study sites / investigators, and provide support for medical education, advisory boards, and medical congresses.&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
