&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Excellent interpersonal, verbal, and written communication skills, with ability to interact with colleagues and partners at all levels of experience.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Proven understanding in global site budget and contract negotiations in order to achieve optimal results and develop plans to meet strategic and operational targets in alignment with RevMed.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
