&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Global Project Level Budget Builds.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Advanced knowledge of Microsoft Word, Excel, PowerPoint and Smartsheet.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
