&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;u&gt;Data + Omnichannel Expertise &amp;amp; Innovation.&lt;/u&gt;&lt;strong&gt; &lt;/strong&gt;Strong understanding of commercial data, analytics, CRM, marketing automation, customer journey orchestration, and digital engagement platforms, including Veeva CRM, Salesforce Marketing Cloud, or comparable tools.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
