&lt;p&gt;&lt;u&gt;Preferred background.&lt;/u&gt;&lt;strong&gt; &lt;/strong&gt;Oncology commercialization or launch experience, targeted therapy or rare-disease experience, and work in a high-growth or pre-commercial biotechnology environment are strongly preferred.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
