&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Experience building or scaling an in-house global SOX function, including centralized standards and regional execution.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Experience implementing SOX automation, evidence workflows, dashboards, analytics, or AI-enabled monitoring.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Public accounting or Big 4 / national firm experience strongly preferred.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
