&lt;p&gt;B.S. in Supply Chain, Engineering, Chemistry, or related discipline required; MBA preferred.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;20+ years of experience in supply chain management within the pharmaceutical or biotech industry.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Deep expertise in supply chain planning, S&amp;amp;OP/C&amp;amp;OP, and inventory management.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Proven experience in launch planning and commercialization support.&lt;/p&gt;
