&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Team-oriented, progressive thinker who enjoys participating in an innovative and creative work environment.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Experience with supply chain integration, production planning, and capacity management.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Demonstrated experience in risk management and supply chain resilience.&lt;/p&gt;
