&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Strategic and execution-oriented leader with strong technical depth and business acumen.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Ability to balance scientific rigor, operational execution, and organizational priorities in a dynamic environment.&lt;/p&gt;
