&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Excellent communication, leadership, and executive presentation skills, with the ability to influence technical and scientific stakeholders.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Demonstrated people leadership, coaching, and organizational development experience.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
