&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Integrate complex SAR, structural biology, biophysical, biochemical, and ADME/PK data to generate testable hypotheses, identify design opportunities, and independently drive compound prioritization strategies for Ro5 and bRo5 molecules.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Act as a strategic partner to medicinal chemistry, proactively proposing compound designs, prioritization frameworks, and risk-mitigation strategies while clearly communicating scientific rationale to project teams and leadership.&lt;/p&gt;
