&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Collaborate with the Advanced Analytics team to help create, validate and advocate AI/ML workflows for molecular design, ensuring the models are statistically rigorous, fit-for-purpose, and aligned with project decision-making needs.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Provide innovative ideas and models&amp;nbsp;to challenge and guide project roadmap while serving as lead computational chemistry representative on drug discovery pipeline projects&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Devise and execute strategies&amp;nbsp;to augment our hit finding abilities for novel protein and protein-protein targets, aid in designing diverse chemical libraries.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
