&lt;p&gt;Experience with Ro5 and bRo5 modalities, including macrocycles, molecular glues, covalent ligands, or other challenging therapeutic modalities.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Experience working in HPC/cloud environments and developing scalable computational workflows.&lt;/p&gt;
