&lt;p&gt;Demonstrated track record of negotiating and executing complex, high-value strategic transactions, potentially including acquisitions, licensing transactions, collaborations, co-development agreements, investments, and other innovative transaction structures.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Deep understanding of biopharmaceutical strategy, drug development, commercialization, portfolio management, valuation, and transaction economics.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Strong strategic and financial acumen with demonstrated ability to evaluate opportunities through both enterprise strategy and capital allocation lenses.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Exceptional negotiation skills and demonstrated ability to navigate complex transactions involving scientific, clinical, commercial, intellectual property, financial, operational, and legal considerations.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Experience advising executive leadership and presenting sophisticated strategic and transaction recommendations to senior executives and Boards of Directors.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Demonstrated ability to lead complex cross-functional initiatives and create alignment among senior stakeholders with different perspectives and priorities.&lt;/p&gt;
