&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Proven people and organizational leadership experience, including building, developing, and leading high-performing teams.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Ability to operate effectively in a dynamic, high-growth environment and balance strategic thinking with hands-on execution.&lt;/p&gt;
